### REST Client (VS Code: ekstensi "REST Client"). Jalankan backend di :3001
@host = http://localhost:3001

### Daftar semua buku
GET {{host}}/books

### Filter (where): status / category / search
GET {{host}}/books?status=sedang
###
GET {{host}}/books?category=Filsafat&search=tan

### Statistik (count)
GET {{host}}/books/stats

### Tambah buku -> 201
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sapiens",
  "author": "Yuval Noah Harari",
  "category": "Sejarah",
  "year": 2011,
  "pages": 443,
  "status": "rencana"
}

### Satu buku (ganti ID)
GET {{host}}/books/GANTI-DENGAN-ID

### Ubah status -> 200
PATCH {{host}}/books/GANTI-DENGAN-ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "selesai" }

### Hapus -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/books/GANTI-DENGAN-ID

### Uji validasi -> 400
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "foo": 1 }
